## 1. Setup (once per project)

```bash
flutter pub add clarity_flutter
```

`[FINGERPRINT]` The Clarity **project id is unique per project** — never
reuse another app's id. Put it in its own file:

```dart
// lib/core/insight_env.dart
const String kClarityProjectId = 'PASTE_PROJECT_ID_HERE';
```

Create the crash-safe facade `lib/core/insight.dart` (copy verbatim —
every call is guarded so a Clarity failure can never crash the gray flow):

```dart
import 'package:clarity_flutter/clarity_flutter.dart';
import 'insight_env.dart';

/// Crash-safe facade over Microsoft Clarity. Replay captures the native
/// surface; these calls add the funnel signals that answer "where did the
/// user drop off?". Never let a Clarity error bubble into the gray flow.
class Insight {
  const Insight._();

  static ClarityConfig get config => ClarityConfig(
        projectId: kClarityProjectId,
        logLevel: LogLevel.None, // verbose only while wiring a new project
      );

  static void identify(String? aid, {Map<String, String> tags = const {}}) {
    if (aid != null && aid.isNotEmpty) {
      _guard(() => Clarity.setCustomUserId(_clip(aid, 255)));
      tag('aid', aid);
    }
    tags.forEach(tag);
  }

  static void screen(String name) { screenName(name); event('screen_$name'); }

  static void screenName(String name) => _guard(() {
        Clarity.setCurrentScreenName(_clip(name, 255));
        Clarity.setCustomTag('last_screen', _clip(name, 255));
      });

  static void event(String name) =>
      _guard(() => Clarity.sendCustomEvent(_clip(name, 254)));

  static void tag(String key, String value) {
    if (value.isEmpty) return;
    _guard(() => Clarity.setCustomTag(key, _clip(value, 255)));
  }

  static String _clip(String v, int max) => v.length <= max ? v : v.substring(0, max);
  static void _guard(void Function() body) { try { body(); } catch (_) {} }
}
```

Wrap the app root in `main.dart` (wrap `FeatheredOriginsApp` — do NOT change the
existing service-assembly order):

```dart
import 'package:clarity_flutter/clarity_flutter.dart';
import 'core/insight.dart';
// ...
runApp(ClarityWidget(
  clarityConfig: Insight.config,
  app: FeatheredOriginsApp(
    vault: vault, probe: probe, signal: signal,
    dispatch: dispatch, pulse: pulse, gateEnabled: gateEnabled,
  ),
));
```

