## 2. Identify the user + track routing (BootScreen)

`lib/screens/boot_screen.dart` is the splash + gray/game decision.

- `initState` → `Insight.screen('loading');`
- Right after `signal.buildPayload(...)` (where `af_id` is known), before
  `dispatch.send(body)`, identify:

```dart
Insight.identify(
  body['af_id']?.toString(),
  tags: {
    'af_status': body['af_status']?.toString() ?? '',
    'media_source': body['media_source']?.toString() ?? '',
    'campaign': body['campaign']?.toString() ?? '',
    'os': body['os']?.toString() ?? '',
    'locale': body['locale']?.toString() ?? '',
  },
);
```

- Tag the run mode + emit one event per routing branch:
  - `_goContent`  → `Insight.tag('run_mode','web'); Insight.event('route_web');`
  - `_goGame`     → `Insight.tag('run_mode','game'); Insight.event('route_game');`
  - `_goOffline`  → `Insight.event('route_offline');`
  - native cold-start push branch → `Insight.event('route_push_link');`
  - one-shot cached url branch → `Insight.event('route_cached_link');`

